## Run it

| | |
|---|---|
| Start | `uv run python harness.py` |
| Check without Slack | `uv run python harness.py --once --dry-run --no-slack` |
| Check it end to end | `uv run python harness.py --verify-plan`, then `docs/verify.md` |
| Is it running, is Slack on | `STATUS.md` (regenerated every tick) |
| What it did and what waits for you | `HEARTBEAT.md` |
| Run log | `logs/harness.jsonl` |

## Where to change what

| To change | Edit | Then |
|---|---|---|
| A character's voice | … | restart |
| When a worker runs | `settings.json` … | restart |
| What a worker watches (URL, repo) | `settings.json` … | restart |
| A worker's procedure | … | nothing, read every run |
| Slack token or channel | `env/harness.env`; re-pair with `uv run python bin/slack-pair.py` | restart |
| Add a character | … | restart |

## Where results land

| | |
|---|---|
| Reports | `tasks/<date>-<id>/work/` … |
| … | … |

## What belongs to the kit

`world/`, `bin/`, `docs/`, `templates/`, and the provider hook folders are replaced when the
installer runs again. Change the kit and re-run it instead of editing them here.
